  "rules": [
    "Only finite licensed noun/descriptor/connective frames are accepted; unknown or unresolved scope refuses without weakening conditions.",
    "One noun head means one actual member; explicit separate heads mean separate existential groups. Coarse shirt/top stays the accepted upper role; explicit trousers/pants means canonical trousers, shorts means shorts and skirt means skirt.",
    "Natural explicit long-sleeve wording requires qualified wrist-length evidence; a field-qualified canonical category value remains only a category and never proves a fine attribute. Historical interpretation records retain their original grammar identity.",
    "Anonymous something plus conjunctive properties binds to one member; role is the intersection of existing default scopes (including base_upper_body for a sleeve claim). Bare something blue retains its existing all_selected existential hard meaning.",
    "Negative modifiers attach to the expressed role/head. No blue trousers forbids the conjunction category=trousers AND primary_colour=blue; it does not prohibit blue skirts.",
    "A blue outfit retains all_present across selected members; a blue top remains upper; prefer/preferably remains guidance, never a new score or saved preference write.",
    "Typed B1 algebra, Known/Unknown/Stale, Deny, exact arithmetic, original taxonomy and frozen historical authorities stay unchanged."
  ],
